			"notes": "This update brings two new professions, the  **Chandler** and the **Glazier**.\nThe Chandler is the master of candles, and along with the **dipping station** will provide villages with all there wax and candle needs!\nThe Glazier brings along with it the **annealer** to shape and form glassware!\n\nFull Changelog:\n* Update SJVT to 1.0.1\n+ Add Dipping Station Block\n+ Add Chandler Profession\n+ Add Annealer Block\n+ Add Glazier Profession \n+ New Dependency: Booking It\n+ New recipe type `extra_professions:annealing` (for annealer smelting)\n+ New village buildings\n+ Added Block and Item tag `c:workstations`"
